note <JSON. parse / stringify and navigation over the host JSON library, hidden per-env. The parsed value is the opaque dynamic value (a JS any, a rust serde_json::Value, a swift / kotlin Any); the accessors read it natively. No hand-rolled parser or value representation.>

load @cluesurf/base/code/native/json
  find do-parse
  find do-stringify
  find do-get-field
  find do-get-item
  find do-as-number
  find do-as-text
  find do-as-boolean
  find do-is-null

task parse
  take text, like text
  like dynamic
  send back
    call do-parse
      read text

task stringify
  take value, like dynamic
  like text
  send back
    call do-stringify
      read value

task get-field
  take value, like dynamic
  take key, like text
  like dynamic
  send back
    call do-get-field
      read value
      read key

task get-item
  take value, like dynamic
  take index, like number
  like dynamic
  send back
    call do-get-item
      read value
      read index

task as-number
  take value, like dynamic
  like decimal
  send back
    call do-as-number
      read value

task as-text
  take value, like dynamic
  like text
  send back
    call do-as-text
      read value

task as-boolean
  take value, like dynamic
  like boolean
  send back
    call do-as-boolean
      read value

task is-null
  take value, like dynamic
  like boolean
  send back
    call do-is-null
      read value
